  "notes": [
    "Freezes the user-approved route-aware formalization feasibility and mandatory human engineering-route decision.",
    "Freezes ENG0-ENG10 mechanical engineering blueprint, verification/validation, application/extension, and evidence-bound master delivery.",
    "Adds mandatory TheoryMasterManuscript delivery and a common audited-master-before-profile workflow for both routes.",
    "Adds four built-in theory journal profiles, four built-in software/systems engineering journal profiles, and route-specific arXiv preprint profiles.",
    "arXiv is modeled as PREPRINT_REPOSITORY, never as a peer-reviewed journal.",
    "V2.4 is a documentation baseline and does not represent implemented functionality.",
    "The manifest intentionally does not hash itself because a self-hash cannot be stable.",
    "Allows OpenCode or the official DeepSeek DSH as engineering clients under the same WorkUnitContract and verification rules."
